\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 # MyPath AI Coach - System Architecture Document\
\
## 1. Overview\
\
The MyPath AI Coach is an AI-powered career advisor integrated into the onboarding flow of the MyPath mobile application. It provides personalized assistance to users, helps gather richer user data, and differentiates the application from competitors by offering dynamic, contextual guidance instead of static forms.\
\
This document outlines the complete system architecture, technology stack, integration points, and implementation requirements for the MyPath AI Coach.\
\
