## 7. API Specifications\
\
### 7.1 OpenAI API\
\
**Base URL:** `https://api.openai.com/v1`\
\
#### Chat Completions Endpoint\
\
- **URL:** `/chat/completions`\
- **Method:** `POST`\
- **Headers:**\
  - `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY`\
  - `Content-Type: application/json`\
- **Request Body:**\
```json\
\{\
  "model": "gpt-4o",\
  "messages": [\
    \{"role": "system", "content": "System prompt..."\},\
    \{"role": "user", "content": "User message..."\}\
  ],\
  "tools": [\
    \{\
      "type": "function",\
      "function": \{\
        "name": "match_career",\
        "description": "Find careers matching a query",\
        "parameters": \{\
          "type": "object",\
          "properties": \{\
            "query": \{\
              "type": "string",\
              "description": "The search query"\
            \},\
            "k": \{\
              "type": "integer",\
              "description": "Number of results"\
            \}\
          \},\
          "required": ["query"]\
        \}\
      \}\
    \}\
  ],\
  "stream": true\
\}\
```\
\
### 7.2 Supabase API\
\
**Base URL:** `https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co`\
\
#### Match Careers Endpoint\
\
- **URL:** `/rest/v1/rpc/match_careers`\
- **Method:** `POST`\
- **Headers:**\
  - `apikey: YOUR_SUPABASE_KEY`\
  - `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_KEY`\
  - `Content-Type: application/json`\
- **Request Body:**\
```json\
\{\
  "query_embedding": [0.1, 0.2, ...],\
  "match_threshold": 0.5,\
  "match_count": 3,\
  "query": "data science"\
\}\
```\
\
#### Update User Profile Endpoint\
\
- **URL:** `/rest/v1/rpc/update_user_profile`\
- **Method:** `POST`\
- **Headers:**\
  - `apikey: YOUR_SUPABASE_KEY`\
  - `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_KEY`\
  - `Content-Type: application/json`\
- **Request Body:**\
```json\
\{\
  "user_id": "auth0|123456",\
  "field": "interests",\
  "value": ["programming", "data science"]\
\}\
```\
