## 10. Security and Privacy Considerations\
\
### 10.1 Data Protection\
\
- All PII data is stored in Supabase with Row Level Security (RLS) policies\
- Authentication tokens are stored securely in the iOS Keychain\
- Local conversations are encrypted using iOS Data Protection\
- API keys are never exposed in client-side code\
\
### 10.2 AI Safety Guardrails\
\
- System prompts include safety instructions\
- OpenAI Moderation API checks all user inputs\
- Relevance classifier prevents off-topic content\
- Human escalation for persistent issues\
\
### 10.3 Error Handling\
\
- Graceful degradation to offline mode when network is unavailable\
- Exponential backoff for API retries\
- User-friendly error messages\
- Comprehensive error logging for debugging\
\
## 11. Performance Considerations\
\
### 11.1 Network Efficiency\
\
- SSE (Server-Sent Events) for efficient streaming\
- Response chunking to minimize latency\
- Caching of frequently used data\
- Batched database operations\
\
### 11.2 Device Performance\
\
- Background processing for heavy operations\
- Memory management for large conversations\
- Battery optimization for voice processing\
- Efficient Core ML model loading\
