## 16.2 What the Coach Actually Does\
\
### 16.2.1 Happy-path sequence (text + voice)\
\
1. **User taps "Assistant \uc0\u65311 "** on *Current Status* page (`stepId=currentStatus`).  \
2. `CoachOverlay` opens, pushes a *context message* to **OpenAI Responses API**.  \
3. **Agents SDK** loads system prompt + `instructions/currentStatus.md` and calls **GPT-4o**.  \
4. GPT-4o streams a greeting ("Need help choosing a life stage? \'85") \'96 bubbles + TTS.  \
5. User asks a question \uc0\u8594  guardrail pipeline (regex \u10140  relevance o1-mini \u10140  moderation).  \
6. Model either responds directly **or** calls a **tool** (`match_career`, `validate_field`, etc.).  \
7. Tools run (Supabase RPC, local validation) \uc0\u8594  results streamed back to UI.  \
8. When user fills the form, Combine emits value \uc0\u8594  `write_user_profile` tool stores it.  \
9. Assistant shows \uc0\u10003  toast and auto-dismisses.\
\
### 16.2.2 Offline & escalation\
\
| Scenario | Flow |\
|----------|------|\
| **No network** | ConversationStore routes prompt to **Core-ML Llama 3 8B** \uc0\u8594  short answer; "Offline mode" badge shown. |\
| **3 consecutive tool errors OR user asks salary in obscure region** | `retryLimiter` triggers `escalate_to_human` tool \uc0\u8594  SendGrid ticket \u8594  user sees "Connecting you to a human coach\'85". |\
\
### 16.2.3 Layered guardrails\
\
1. Regex / length filter (client)  \
2. Relevance classifier (o1-mini)  \
3. OpenAI Moderation API  \
4. Tool-risk registry (blocks `high` risk writes)  \
5. Retry-to-human escalation\
\
